\title{rlvm-machine - ownership}
\taxon{Report}
\date{2026-11-24}
\author{claude-fable-5-2}
\contributor{queclr}
\tag{machine}
\meta{origin}{rlvm-machine/OWNERSHIP.md}
\meta{moved}{2026-11-24}
\import{base-macros}

\p{\strong{This module (\code{\verb~|rlvm-machine/~}, Java package \code{\verb~|rlvm.machine~}) is created and owned by the workflow \code{\verb~|rlvm-wave4-machine~} as of 2026-11-24.}}

\p{Any agent that belongs to another workflow MUST NOT create, modify, move or delete anything under \code{\verb~|rlvm-machine/~}, under \code{\verb~|work/sandbox/~}, or the scripts \src{scripts/machine-sandbox.sh} and \src{scripts/machine-sandbox-selftest.sh}. An agent of another workflow that was asked to "create the machine skeleton" reads this file, verifies, and reports only (ISA 13.1, orchestrator note). Requests from outside the workflow go to \code{\verb~|work/status/requests.log~} as a line \code{\verb~|from -> machine (M6): request~}.}

\p{Inside the workflow every file belongs to exactly one work package. The machine-readable table is \code{\verb~|rlvm-machine/OWNERS.tsv~}; \src{scripts/machine-sandbox.sh} enforces it (a package can publish only the files it owns). The packages, the sandbox workflow and the rules are in \code{\verb~|WORK-PACKAGES.md~}.}

\subtree{
\title{File-to-package table}

\p{Main tree (\code{\verb~|src/main/java/rlvm/machine/~}):}

\table{
\tr{\th{Package}\th{Files}\th{Role}}
\tr{\td{M1}\td{\code{\verb~|Values~}, \code{\verb~|Runs~}, \code{\verb~|Lits~}, \code{\verb~|Levels~}, \code{\verb~|Scope~}}\td{value records and interning, runs and environments, literal bridge, levels and substitutions, binders}}
\tr{\td{M2}\td{\code{\verb~|Eval~}}\td{family EV: \code{\verb~|EVAL~}, \code{\verb~|FORCE~}, \code{\verb~|APPLY~}, \code{\verb~|INST~}, \code{\verb~|ARGV~}, \code{\verb~|DOM~}}}
\tr{\td{M3}\td{\code{\verb~|Reduce~}, \code{\verb~|NatRed~}, \code{\verb~|StrRed~}, \code{\verb~|Rules~}}\td{family RD: \code{\verb~|DELTA~}, \code{\verb~|CORE~}, \code{\verb~|WHNF~}, \code{\verb~|IOTA~}, \code{\verb~|QUOTR~}; \code{\verb~|NATOP~}, \code{\verb~|NATFOLD~}, \code{\verb~|OFFSET~}; \code{\verb~|STRVIEW~}; case trees}}
\tr{\td{M4}\td{\code{\verb~|Conv~}, \code{\verb~|Cargs~}, \code{\verb~|Pairs~}}\td{family CV: \code{\verb~|CONV~} and its sub-judgments; \code{\verb~|CARGS~}; the pair table and \code{\verb~|UNDEC~}}}
\tr{\td{M5}\td{\code{\verb~|Infer~}, \code{\verb~|Decl~}, \code{\verb~|Facts~}, \code{\verb~|FactStore~}}\td{family TY: \code{\verb~|INFER~}, \code{\verb~|CHECK~}, \code{\verb~|VTYPE~}, \code{\verb~|ENSORT~}, \code{\verb~|ENPI~}, \code{\verb~|ISPROP~}; the \code{\verb~|DECL~} driver; static facts}}
\tr{\td{M6}\td{\code{\verb~|Layout~}, \code{\verb~|Op~}, \code{\verb~|Hash~}, \code{\verb~|Machine~}, \code{\verb~|Frames~}, \code{\verb~|Ops~}, \code{\verb~|MachineProvider~}, \code{\verb~|MachineEngine~}, \code{\verb~|MachineSession~}, \code{\verb~|MachineOps~}, \code{\verb~|Debug~}, \code{\verb~|Show~}, \code{\verb~|package-info~}; \code{\verb~|pom.xml~}; \code{\verb~|src/main/resources/META-INF/services/rlvm.api.EngineProvider~}; \code{\verb~|README.md~}}\td{shared definitions (frozen), machine state and control primitives, facade, debug modes, diagnostics printer, module build}}
\tr{\td{M7}\td{\code{\verb~|Elab~}, \code{\verb~|Code~}, \code{\verb~|CodeStore~}, \code{\verb~|Match~}, \code{\verb~|Cong~}}\td{K1 elaborator, code stepper (family CODE), block store, \code{\verb~|MATCH~}, comparison plans}}
}

\p{Test tree (\code{\verb~|src/test/java/rlvm/machine/~}):}

\table{
\tr{\th{Package}\th{Files}}
\tr{\td{M6}\td{\code{\verb~|Fixture~}, \code{\verb~|Sexp~}, \code{\verb~|Prelude~}, \code{\verb~|Toy~}, \code{\verb~|TestTables~}, \code{\verb~|ControlTest~}, \code{\verb~|MachineStateTest~}, \code{\verb~|FixtureTest~}, \code{\verb~|StepSizeTest~} (shared test support and the tests of the shared code)}}
\tr{\td{M8}\td{\code{\verb~|Quote~}, \code{\verb~|TierEq~}, \code{\verb~|Diff~}}}
\tr{\td{M1 .. M8}\td{by naming convention: test classes \code{\verb~|M<k>*.java~}, test resources \code{\verb~|src/test/resources/m<k>/~}, notes \code{\verb~|NOTES-M<k>.md~}}}
}

\p{Owned by nobody (edited in the main tree only, never published from a sandbox): \code{\verb~|OWNERS.tsv~} (through \code{\verb~|scripts/machine-sandbox.sh claim WP PATH~}, or by M6 under the lock), \code{\verb~|OWNERSHIP.md~}, \code{\verb~|WORK-PACKAGES.md~}.}

\p{A new main class is claimed before it is published: \code{\verb~|scripts/machine-sandbox.sh claim M3 src/main/java/rlvm/machine/WhnfLoop.java~}.}
}

